    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peluchín parece interesado en la Diancita.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065006C00750063006800ED006E002000700061007200650063006500200069006E0074006500720065007300610064006F00200065006E0020006C00610020004400690061006E0063006900740061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pu, purr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00500075002C00200070007500720072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Espurr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073007000750072007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... Creo que captó algo\npor telepatía.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E0020004300720065006F00200071007500650020006300610070007400F300200061006C0067006F000A0070006F0072002000740065006C006500700061007400ED0061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De hecho, Peluchín es capaz de transmitir\npensamientos de una mente a otra.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es una habilidad increíble, pero desgastante.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor eso siempre le pido que intente usarla lo\nmenos posible, aunque a veces percibe los<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npensamientos sin querer, como ahora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me pregunto qué habrá descubierto...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Quizás la Diancita contenía algún\npensamiento? Qué curioso...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que deberíamos seguir a Peluchín para\nver a dónde nos lleva.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300720065006F002000710075006500200064006500620065007200ED0061006D006F0073002000730065006700750069007200200061002000500065006C00750063006800ED006E00200070006100720061000A007600650072002000610020006400F3006E006400650020006E006F00730020006C006C006500760061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que está percibiendo algo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720065006300650020007100750065002000650073007400E1002000700065007200630069006200690065006E0064006F00200061006C0067006F002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hola, Bibi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006C0061002C00200042006900620069002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy en medio de una investigación con\nPeluchín y creo que necesito tu ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avísale a Trini y Mani también, porfa. ¡Hasta luego!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007600ED00730061006C0065002000610020005400720069006E0069002000790020004D0061006E0069002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002C00200070006F007200660061002E002000A1004800610073007400610020006C007500650067006F002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdón. Eran unos amigos con los que\nestoy colaborando hace tiempo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006400F3006E002E0020004500720061006E00200075006E006F007300200061006D00690067006F007300200063006F006E0020006C006F00730020007100750065000A006500730074006F007900200063006F006C00610062006F00720061006E0064006F002000680061006300650020007400690065006D0070006F002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ah, sí?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00410068002C0020007300ED003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes amigos?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200061006D00690067006F0073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, de hecho, heredé la agencia de un\ndetective llamado Looker.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C00200064006500200068006500630068006F002C00200068006500720065006400E90020006C00610020006100670065006E00630069006100200064006500200075006E000A0064006500740065006300740069007600650020006C006C0061006D00610064006F0020004C006F006F006B00650072002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por eso se llama así la agencia!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0072002000650073006F0020007300650020006C006C0061006D006100200061007300ED0020006C00610020006100670065006E00630069006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El que da nombre a la agencia, ¿no?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200071007500650020006400610020006E006F006D006200720065002000610020006C00610020006100670065006E006300690061002C002000BF006E006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Exacto. Era un hombre muy amable de quien\naprendí muchas cosas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450078006100630074006F002E002000450072006100200075006E00200068006F006D0062007200650020006D0075007900200061006D00610062006C006500200064006500200071007500690065006E000A0061007000720065006E006400ED0020006D0075006300680061007300200063006F007300610073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, como trabaja también para la Policía\nInternacional, tuvo que irse para encargarse<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde un caso...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que no me quedó otra que pedirles ayuda a\nesos amigos y a Peluchín para poder seguir<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon la agencia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La verdad es que no podría haberlo hecho sin\nPeluchín. ¡Hemos resuelto muchísimos casos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngracias a sus poderes telepáticos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, como ya te conté antes, usarlos lo fatiga\nmucho.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F002C00200063006F006D006F00200079006100200074006500200063006F006E007400E900200061006E007400650073002C00200075007300610072006C006F00730020006C006F0020006600610074006900670061000A006D007500630068006F002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pu, purr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00500075002C00200070007500720072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Espurr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073007000750072007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Vamos, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!\n¡Sigámoslo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
